<title>MOROCCO: PRESS DIGEST - Morocco - March 3.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Morocco - March 3.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Moroccan press on Monday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>LE MATIN DU SAHARA</p>
<p>- King Hassan grants pardon measures for prisoners.</p>
<p>L'OPINION</p>
<p>- King Hassan presides over official ceremonies and addresses the nation on the occasion of the Throne Feast, marking the 36th anniversary of his accession.</p>
<p>LE QUOTIDIEN</p>
<p>- Political parties and the government sign a Charter of Honour to hold fair elections.</p>
<p>AL-BAYANE</p>
<p>- Morocco celebrates Throne Feast.</p>
</text>
